      "versionNonce": 532659711,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "将长短期记忆协同建模为统一 MDP，通过三阶段渐进轨迹与 Step-wise GRPO 解决跨阶段稀疏归因",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
