      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. 三阶段渐进 RL 训练课程（解耦并阻断捷径泄漏）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 三阶段渐进 RL 训练课程（解耦并阻断捷径泄漏）",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 982.1,
      "width": 2250.7,
      "height": 138.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 486546387,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1625677747,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Stage 1（LTM 构建）：在日常交互上下文中自主识别有价值信息写入 LTM；\n• Stage 2（抗干扰 STM 控噪）：【强制清空短期上下文、保留 LTM】，合成注入拟真无关干扰句（DistractorGen），逼迫模型学会调用 FILTER / SUMMARY 控噪防溢出；\n• Stage 3（联合检索解题）：收到正式任务查询，协同检索 LTM、管理 STM 并输出最终答案。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Stage 1（LTM 构建）：在日常交互上下文中自主识别有价值信息写入 LTM；\n• Stage 2（抗干扰 STM 控噪）：【强制清空短期上下文、保留 LTM】，合成注入拟真无关干扰句（DistractorGen），逼迫模型学会调用 FILTER / SUMMARY 控噪防溢出；\n• Stage 3（联合检索解题）：收到正式任务查询，协同检索 LTM、管理 STM 并输出最终答案。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
